# Software manifest for the apt repository published at https://apt.zitzhen.cn
# Format: one HTTPS GitHub repository URL per line.
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# Every listed repository must contain a debian/ directory so that the workflow
# can build an amd64 .deb package with dpkg-buildpackage.
# Duplicate URLs are ignored.

https://github.com/zitzhen/patchsplit
